#
# The data directory and the default checkpoint store (D-063). Installed as
# /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/llmp.conf. No age, so nothing here is ever cleaned.
# The checkpoint store's mode and owner apply only when it is created (":").
d /var/lib/llmp 0755 llmp llmp -
d /var/lib/llmp/checkpoints :1777 :llmp :llmp -
